Backport of upstream pull request #304 (samestep): fix quadratic slowdown.

Track forest roots in a set instead of a sequence (roots were re-sorted
on every state change and filtered linearly on every insert), sorting
once in the printer instead.

https://github.com/maralorn/nix-output-monitor/pull/304

